      "content": "Dưới đây là phần bổ sung cho script `extended_design_system.py` để bạn thêm các mẫu thiết kế mới theo ảnh 9, 10, 11, 12. Mỗi mẫu đều theo hướng:\n- 9: Du lịch Việt Nam — kiểu mộc, xanh lục nhạt, nét thư pháp / watercolor.\n- 10: Thị phả / Văn học — giấy xước, đỏ nâu, Serif cổ điển.\n- 11: Mục lục / du lịch / nền xanh, nhẹ, thanh thoát.\n- 12: Thiết kế vòng lặp “watercolor + heritage + travel” rất phù hợp để làm 1 bộ slide du lịch / hình ảnh văn hoá.\n\nTôi bổ sung vào script hiện có 3 theme mới:\n- `vietnam_travel`\n- `ink_literature`\n- `green_travel`\n\nCode bổ sung (chèn vào file `extended_design_system.py` phía dưới phần `THEMES`):\n\n```python\n# -------------------------------------------------\n# 1) Bổ sung thêm 3 theme mới:\n# -------------------------------------------------\nTHEMES.update({\n    \"vietnam_travel\": {\n        \"bg\": (239, 244, 239),        # xanh nhạt\n        \"bg2\": (228, 235, 224),\n        \"panel\": (250, 249, 245),\n        \"accent\": (84, 118, 93),      # xanh rêu\n        \"accent2\": (187, 164, 104),   # vàng đất\n        \"text\": (26, 25, 25),\n        \"title\": (52, 72, 50),\n        \"line\": (146, 171, 134),\n        \"zoneA\": (237, 244, 234),\n        \"zoneB\": (225, 238, 221),\n        \"zoneC\": (205, 220, 201),\n    },\n    \"ink_literature\": {\n        \"bg\": (244, 235, 227),        # giấy xước\n        \"bg2\": (214, 201, 184),\n        \"panel\": (249, 244, 238),\n        \"accent\": (106, 36, 30),      # đỏ nâu\n        \"accent2\": (183, 139, 84),    # vàng nâu\n        \"text\": (31, 21, 14),\n        \"title\": (92, 42, 30),\n        \"line\": (177, 127, 92),\n        \"zoneA\": (244, 235, 227),\n        \"zoneB\": (218, 210, 195),\n        \"zoneC\": (170, 130, 102),\n    },\n    \"green_travel\": {\n        \"bg\": (218, 235, 220),        # nền xanh cổ điển\n        \"bg2\": (197, 214, 190),\n        \"panel\": (247, 249, 240),\n        \"accent\": (51, 96, 74),       # xanh đậm\n        \"accent2\": (195, 172, 93),    # gold\n        \"text\": (28, 38, 32),\n        \"title\": (38, 65, 48),\n        \"line\": (168, 190, 148),\n        \"zoneA\": (232, 244, 233),\n        \"zoneB\": (212, 228, 205),\n        \"zoneC\": (182, 203, 170),\n    },\n})\n```\n\nSau đó chèn thêm các builder mới sau phần `make_focus_slide`:\n\n```python\n# -------------------------------------------------\n# Bổ sung builder kiểu Vietnam Ink / Travel / Literature\n# -------------------------------------------------\ndef make_ink_hero_slide(prs, theme, title, subtitle=None):\n    slide = prs.slides.add_slide(prs.slide_layouts[6])\n    set_bg(slide, THEMES[theme][\"bg\"])\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"E\", \"bg\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"A1\", \"corner\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"A2\", \"corner\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"C\", \"baseline\")\n\n    panel = add_panel(slide, Inches(0.7), Inches(0.7), Inches(11.8), Inches(5.7), THEMES[theme][\"panel\"], THEMES[theme][\"line\"], radius=18)\n    add_textbox(slide, Inches(1.2), Inches(1.2), Inches(5.0), Inches(1.0), title, \"Playfair Display\", 30, THEMES[theme][\"title\"], True, \"left\")\n    if subtitle:\n        add_textbox(slide, Inches(1.2), Inches(2.2), Inches(5.0), Inches(0.6), subtitle, \"Be Vietnam Pro\", 13, THEMES[theme][\"text\"], False, \"left\")\n\n    # placeholder image region on right\n    img_box = slide.shapes.add_shape(MSO_SHAPE.RECTANGLE, Inches(8.0), Inches(1.5), Inches(3.4), Inches(3.8))\n    img_box.fill.solid()\n    img_box.fill.fore_color.rgb = rgb(THEMES[theme][\"bg2\"])\n    img_box.line.color.rgb = rgb(THEMES[theme][\"line\"])\n    img_box.line.width = Pt(1.2)\n    return slide\n\ndef make_ink_two_col_slide(prs, theme, title, left_items, right_items, caption=None):\n    slide = prs.slides.add_slide(prs.slide_layouts[6])\n    set_bg(slide, THEMES[theme][\"bg\"])\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"E\", \"bg\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"A1\", \"corner\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"A2\", \"corner\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"C\", \"baseline\")\n\n    left_panel = add_panel(slide, Inches(0.8), Inches(1.1), Inches(5.6), Inches(4.9), THEMES[theme][\"panel\"], THEMES[theme][\"line\"], radius=16)\n    right_panel = add_panel(slide, Inches(6.8), Inches(1.1), Inches(5.6), Inches(4.9), THEMES[theme][\"panel\"], THEMES[theme][\"line\"], radius=16)\n\n    add_textbox(slide, Inches(1.1), Inches(1.4), Inches(4.8), Inches(0.8), title, \"Playfair Display\", 24, THEMES[theme][\"title\"], True, \"left\")\n    add_bullets(slide, Inches(1.15), Inches(2.2), Inches(4.4), Inches(2.8), left_items, \"Be Vietnam Pro\", 15, THEMES[theme][\"text\"])\n    add_bullets(slide, Inches(7.1), Inches(2.2), Inches(4.4), Inches(2.8), right_items, \"Be Vietnam Pro\", 15, THEMES[theme][\"text\"])\n\n    if caption:\n        add_textbox(slide, Inches(1.1), Inches(5.6), Inches(10.8), Inches(0.6), caption, \"Be Vietnam Pro\", 11, THEMES[theme][\"text\"], False, \"center\")\n    return slide\n\ndef make_landscape_photo_slide(prs, theme, title, caption, left_text=None, right_text=None):\n    slide = prs.slides.add_slide(prs.slide_layouts[6])\n    set_bg(slide, THEMES[theme][\"bg\"])\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"E\", \"bg\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"A1\", \"corner\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"A2\", \"corner\")\n    add_zone_decor(slide, theme, \"C\", \"baseline\")\n\n    # main photo area\n    photo = slide.shapes.add_shape(MSO_SHAPE.RECTANGLE, Inches(1.1), Inches(1.5), Inches(6.5), Inches(3.8))\n    photo.fill.solid()\n    photo.fill.fore_color.rgb = rgb(THEMES[theme][\"bg2\"])\n    photo.line.color.rgb = rgb(THEMES[theme][\"line\"])\n    photo.line.width = Pt(1.2)\n\n    # text block\n    add_textbox(slide, Inches(7.9), Inches(1.6), Inches(4.2), Inches(0.8), title, \"Playfair Display\", 22, THEMES[theme][\"title\"], True, \"left\")\n    if left_text:\n        add_bullets(slide, Inches(7.9), Inches(2.5), Inches(3.